===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|stricken|t=to tie, to knit}}, from {{inh|de|goh|stricken|t=to tie}}, derived from the noun {{m|goh|stric}}, whence modern {{m|de|Strick|t=short rope for binding}}. Compare {{cog|nl|strikken}}. Displaced {{m+|gmh|bretten|t=to knit}}. The obsolete sense “to tie” still underlies in compounds (see below).

